Declaring multiple variables on one line is difficult to read.

Noncompliant Code Example
    
    
    class MyClass {
    
      private int a, b;
    
      public void method(){
        int c; int d;
      }
    }
    

Compliant Solution
    
    
    class MyClass {
    
      private int a;
      private int b;
    
      public void method(){
        int c;
        int d;
      }
    }
    

